===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''[[ethnic]] [[cleansing]]'''

# the [[mass]] [[extermination]] or [[expulsion]] of [[people]] within a certain [[area]], especially people of a [[minority]] ethnic or [[religious]] [[group]]

